    "questionText": "Given $\\vec{a} = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ -3 \\end{pmatrix}$ and $\\vec{b} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 4 \\end{pmatrix}$, calculate $2\\vec{a} + 3\\vec{b}$.",
